OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Frain this evening and into the night,
OL,7,Fbecoming heavier at times, especially
OL,8,Fin the west. The Isles turning clearer
OL,9,Flater with scattered showers.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FAny lingering rain in the
OL,12,Fnortheast soon clearing. Then a day of
OL,13,Fsunny intervals and blustery showers,
OL,14,Fthese heavier and more frequent in the
OL,15,Fwest. Windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
