OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday will be another day of
OL,7,Ffrequent showers, heavy at times, and
OL,8,Fsome sunny intervals. Mainly dry and
OL,9,Fbright on Sunday, light showers in
OL,10,Fnorth. Cloudier Monday with patchy
OL,11,Frain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
